# RiteMark Patch: exact save receipts
#
# Purpose: Bind Ritemark's local-save receipt to the exact logical text snapshot handed to the file service.
#
# Why: Reading the file path from onDidSave can race with an external writer and suppress a real two-writer conflict.
#      A save VS Code refuses as newer, for a document Ritemark's editor holds, goes to Ritemark's document sync first, so the person
#      gets one question (Ritemark's Review changes) or none (only the file's date or line endings moved), never two (#454).
#
